span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">2007</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년부터 매년 개최되어 온 국제 과학 행사입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp; 2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">기초과학연구원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">이하 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">IBS)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">ASC </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">한국 사무국으로서 올해 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">11</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; ms